  :word sequence-cause
  Why order appears in an address at all — and exactly what an engine may optimize.
  |invariants
    - Belongs to [[term/path]]
    - Cause is exactly one of: subset-sequence | resolver-sequence | compositional — per step, never per address
    - Subset-sequences reorder and fuse; compositional sequences fold when endpoint-only; resolver-sequences are pipeline barriers
  |open
    Exhaustiveness: three causes demonstrated, "exactly three" unargued; candidate fourth (mid-address perspective-shift) awaits the act-anatomy adjudication.
